> $T(STS^{-1})^{-1}=\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\1&1\end{pmatrix}$ for the minimal four moves, on
> $\mathbb T^2$ with linear parts $S^{\pm1},T^{\pm1}$, where
> $S=\begin{pmatrix}0&-1\\1&0\end{pmatrix}$ and $T=\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\0&1\end{pmatrix}$) or, on
> $\mathbb T^1$, a translation of infinite order. (v2 `main.tex:316`)

> An isometry spherical family is a universal EGF family provided its model realizes
> $\forwardalpha^i\equiv\frac1p$ and a set of outflows dense in the non-negative cone of
> $L^2(\Statespace,\lambda)$, and the $\Phi_i$ generate a dense subgroup of
> $\mathrm{SO}_{d+1}(\mathbb R)$, $d\geq1$. (v2 `main.tex:333`)

